    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "text": "When a user opened the document and enabled macros, the macro launched PowerShell with an encoded command.",
   "char_start": 224,
   "char_end": 330,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0002",
     "p": 0.9998,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1059",
     "p": 0.9873,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0005",
     "p": 0.7283,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1204",
     "p": 0.4857,
     "passed": false
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0004",
     "p": 0.1965,
     "passed": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "text": "The PowerShell script downloaded a second-stage loader from a compromised WordPress site and saved it in the user's AppData folder.",
   "char_start": 332,
   "char_end": 463,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0008",
     "p": 0.9792,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0042",
     "p": 0.948,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0011",
     "p": 0.8787,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1105",
     "p": 0.8655,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0001",
     "p": 0.7975,
     "passed": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "text": "To survive reboots, the loader created a scheduled task named OneDriveUpdate that ran every hour.",
   "char_start": 464,
   "char_end": 561,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0004",
     "p": 0.9938,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0002",
     "p": 0.9927,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1053",
     "p": 0.9906,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0003",
     "p": 0.9863,
     "passed": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "text": "It also added a Run key to the registry.",
   "char_start": 562,
   "char_end": 602,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "T1547",
     "p": 0.9711,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0004",
     "p": 0.9552,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0003",
     "p": 0.8976,
     "passed": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "text": "Once on the host, the actors ran whoami, ipconfig and net group \"domain admins\" /domain to learn about the user and the network.",
   "char_start": 604,
   "char_end": 732,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0007",
     "p": 1.0,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1033",
     "p": 0.9598,
     "passed": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "text": "They used a renamed copy of Mimikatz to dump credentials from LSASS memory.",
   "char_start": 733,
   "char_end": 808,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "T1003",
     "p": 0.9863,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0006",
     "p": 0.9537,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1210",
     "p": 0.122,
     "passed": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "text": "With the stolen administrator password, the operators moved laterally to the file server over RDP and used PsExec to run commands on several workstations.",
   "char_start": 810,
   "char_end": 964,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0008",
     "p": 0.9908,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1021",
     "p": 0.9325,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "TA0005",
     "p": 0.1374,
     "passed": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "text": "The malware disabled Windows Defender real-time protection and cleared the Security event log to hide its activity.",
   "char_start": 965,
   "char_end": 1080,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0005",
     "p": 0.9994,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1562",
     "p": 0.6832,
     "passed": true
    },
    {
     "id": "T1070",
     "p": 0.6782,
     "passed": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "text": "Files from the finance share were collected, compressed into a password-protected RAR archive and staged in a temporary folder.",
   "char_start": 1082,
   "char_end": 1209,
   "page": null,
   "skipped": null,
   "labels": [
    {
     "id": "TA0009",
